em when they point somewhere): "This town is known as the grave site of POK.MON. Memorial services are held in POK.MON TOWER."; "Hello.. Lovely weather, isn\'t it? It\'s so pleasant.. ..Oh, dear.. I must have dozed off. Welcome. My name is ERIKA. I am the LEADER of CELADON GYM. I am a stude"; "Hello.. Lovely weather, isn\'t it? It\'s so pleasant.. ..Oh, dear.. I must have dozed off. Welcome. My name is ERIKA. I am the LEADER of CELADON GYM. I am a stude"; "I didn\'t bring my best POK.MON. Wait until next time!". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and head to Fuchsia City for the Soul Badge. Next: Your ace already clears Koga\'s level bar — march to Fuchsia City; train the bench on the road (not parked grass). Bigger picture: Reach Fuchsia City, beat Koga for the Soul Badge. Your team right now: blastoise (L51), ekans (L16), spearow (L18), rattata (L18), abra the kadabra (L19), caterpie the butterfree (L17). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "4 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade, Thunder, Rainbow). Next gym: Koga of Fuchsia City. Pokédex: 12 caught. She's four badges — halfway to the League now (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'blastoise (L51), ekans (L16), spearow (L18), rattata (L18), abra the kadabra (L19), caterpie the butterfree (L17)', 'goal': {'short': "You're ready — stop grinding and head to Fuchsia City for the Soul Badge", 'medium': "Your ace already clears Koga's level bar — march to Fuchsia City; train the bench on the road (not parked grass)", 'long': 'Reach Fuchsia City, beat Koga for the Soul Badge'}} options=['regroup']

